direction: right
inspect: "Inspect repository + installed APIs"
contract: "Acceptance contract\nScope, risks, concrete checks"
plan: "D2 implementation plan"
slice: "Runnable vertical slice\nRendering verified first for games"
build: "Implement features + regression tests"
verify: "Run checks against source fingerprint\nRecord exit status + output tail"
review: "Adversarial review\nInteraction + visual + failure paths"
repair: "Repair failures (bounded)\nFailing check + quoted output tail"
deliver: "Evidence + launch instructions\nExplicit limitations"
inspect -> contract -> plan -> slice -> build -> verify -> review -> deliver
verify -> repair: failed / stale
review -> repair: defect
repair -> verify
